            "text": "People may find it demanding to create a goal which will take a long time to achieve.",
            "answer": "A",
            "analysis": "。由题干关键信息demanding ` Creale 3 goal和take Iong time tO achieve 定位到A段。该段第三句 提到,即便如此,试图设定可实现的目标, 并为之努力多年。也可能极具挑战性。由此可见。题干是对 该句的同义转述 其中create a goal which will take a long time t0 achieve 对应原文中的set achievable goals that yoU 'II work for over the course of many years 而may find it demanding 对应原文中的can be extremely challenging。"
