            "analysis": "题干译文 computer knowledge 和skills Of solving problems 定位到K段。下段 笫三句提到,他 [一位放射治疗物理师 将自己能接触电脑归功于像《魔法宫殿》那样的老式游戏。每一 次游戏敞本更新都提高了他对电肫运作原理的了解。最后-句引用马克 朗的话提到: \"大多数电子游戏 题干是对这两句内容的概括。 其中A physicist 是原词重现; admits gaming has contributed to his computer knowledge 是对原文中credits old- school games like Palace Of Maeic with exposing him to computers 以 及 Every new gaming uperade improved his knowledge of how they worked的概括; 而skills of solving problem 与 原文中的problem-solving同义 故答 [豳 G。由题干关键信息Game Academy , proposes to help gamers , develop their skills 和critical thinking 定位到6段。G段笫二句提到 '有意识' 的玩家 = 运用批判性思维来发展 自己的技能。题干是对该句的同义转述。其中Game Academy proposes 对应原文牛 的part of Game Academy 's 【第14页] suggcstion is; to help gamers develop their skills using Critical thinking是对原爻中t0 transform casual gamers into conscious ones, applying critical thinking to developing their skills的概括总结,故答案为G。"
