            "analysis": "项任务。 那么在心理上转换到下一件事情就会袼外困难。题干 中的exhausted to 8 dangerous degree 是原文中 drained to dangerous levels的同义转迷; 题干中的it is extremely hard for them to transition to the next task则对 应原文中的making the mental switch to the next thing is extra tough。"
