            "analysis": "islinguish betwecn.and. 定位到C段笫2旬。原文此处提 到,最睿智的领导者藿得区分 '过早放弃\" 与 '执着于不该执着之事\" 的不同。本题是对此句的同义转 述 对应 discer the difference between。 and giving Up tOO soon 对应quitting too soon; stickine with somethine irrationally 对应 holding somnething that shouldn t 数据可以揭示你正考虑的任何-项事业的实际成功概率。本题是对此句的同义转迷 其中 When people are thinking Ofan endeavor对应原文中的 whatever endeavor you are contemplatine; dig out reliable data 对 应seek out hard data; how likely they are t0 succeed 对 应real chance Ofsuccess。"
